 "vyzhimka": {
  "tekst": "I searched specifically for \"businessinteldna.com\" and related terms, but I was unable to find any direct information about this specific website or company in my search results. None of the results returned actual content from or about businessinteldna.com specifically — instead, they surfaced unrelated companies with similar-sounding names (like Fiserv's \"Business Intelligence for DNA\" banking software, various \"Business DNA\" consulting firms in different countries, and unrelated \"DNA\"-named businesses/scam reports).\n\nGiven this, I can't confirm:\n- Who owns or operates businessinteldna.com\n- Whether it has any registered business filings, BBB profile, or verifiable reviews\n- Whether it is legitimate or a scam\n\n**What I'd recommend to verify it yourself:**\n1. **WHOIS lookup** – Check domain registration details (registrant name, creation date, registrar) using a tool like whois.com. Be aware many scam sites use privacy-shielding services to hide ownership, which is itself a caution flag.\n2. **BBB.org search** – Search the exact business name/domain on the Better Business Bureau site for complaints or a business profile.\n3. **Trustpilot / SiteJabber** – Search the exact domain for customer reviews.\n4. **Check for a physical address and phone number** on the site itself, then verify that address isn't a UPS store, virtual office, or unrelated location — a common red flag seen in similar cases (e.g., one reviewer noted a \"scam\" site's address belongs to FreeHostingNoAds.Net).\n5. **LinkedIn** – Search for the company name to see if real employees with verifiable profiles are listed.\n6. **Secretary of State business registry** – If the site claims incorporation in a specific U.S. state, search that state's Secretary of State corporate database.\n\nIf you can share more details about what the site claims to offer (e.g., BI consulting, software, data broker services) or any specific claims/contact info listed on it, I can try a more targeted search to help assess legitimacy.",
